---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" path="/about/">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 md:px-6 md:py-16">
    <h1 class="dr-page-h1">
      <span class="lang-en-strict">About Digital Rulebook</span>
      <span class="lang-zh-only">关于 Digital Rulebook</span>
    </h1>

    <div class="dr-body mt-8 space-y-5">
      <p>
        <span class="lang-en-only">
          Digital Rulebook collects key EU digital regulations and presents them
          side-by-side in English and Chinese. The aim is a fast, focused reading
          experience for practitioners, students and researchers who navigate
          between the two languages.
        </span>
        <span class="lang-zh-only">
          Digital Rulebook 汇集欧盟主要数字监管法规，以中英双语左右对照呈现，
          为在两种语言间工作的从业者、学生与研究者提供专注、快速的阅读体验。
        </span>
      </p>
      <p>
        <span class="lang-en-only">
          Each provision links to a stable URL. Texts shown here are for reference
          only — the authoritative version is always the one published in the
          Official Journal of the European Union.
        </span>
        <span class="lang-zh-only">
          每个条款都对应稳定的 URL。本站文本仅供参考 ——
          法律的权威文本始终以《欧盟官方公报》上发布的版本为准。
        </span>
      </p>
      <p>
        <span class="lang-en-only">
          The site is open and static — Astro + Tailwind, no tracking. Suggestions
          and corrections are welcome.
        </span>
        <span class="lang-zh-only">
          本站为纯静态开源项目，使用 Astro + Tailwind 构建，无任何追踪。
          欢迎反馈与勘误建议。
        </span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
